sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as 👤 Operator
  participant Env as 📄 .env.example
  participant YCR as 📦 cr.yandex
  participant S as ⚙ install.sh
  participant C as 🐳 compose
  participant V as 🔐 Vault
  participant KC as 🛡 Keycloak

  rect rgb(235, 248, 255)
    Note over Op,YCR: Подготовка (вручную)
    Op->>Env: заполнить секреты, JWT, ROUTER_CIDR
    Op->>Op: cp .env.example .env && chmod 600
    Op->>YCR: docker login iam / oauth
  end

  rect rgb(240, 255, 244)
    Note over Op,KC: Автоматическая установка
    Op->>S: ./install.sh
    S->>S: проверка .env
    S->>S: vault-values.json если нет
    S->>C: pull
    S->>C: up pg · keycloak · vault
    S->>V: bootstrap-vault.sh
    S->>KC: пароли пользователей realm
    Note right of KC: .keycloak-passwords
    S->>C: up -d --wait
    S->>S: health checks
    Note right of S: не curl Router :30115/health/ready
  end
